## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
Core thesis: GLD offers the most liquid and cost-effective way to gain exposure to gold, serving as a hedge against inflation and market volatility. Compared to peers like SLV (silver ETF) or physical gold storage, GLD's lower fees and higher liquidity make it more attractive.  

**Bull Case:** Gold prices rise due to continued inflation or geopolitical tensions.  
**Bear Case:** Central banks tighten monetary policy, reducing gold's appeal as a safe haven.  

